name: ticket_types
description: Per-type steps for a ticket labelled type:bug, type:feature or plan, with a readiness check that sends a bug or feature missing a required section back to Backlog; renders nothing for an untyped ticket.
vars: [issue]

Render it with a left-trimming render tag (a dash after its opening brace): each
branch starts with its own blank line, so an untyped ticket's prompt stays
byte-identical to one without the render. When a ticket has several type labels,
`plan` wins over `type:bug`, and `type:bug` over `type:feature`. The templates the
operator writes these tickets from live in `docs/ticket-templates/`.
